---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Clean Air Program — Insulation & Facade Subsidy 2025/2026" description="Clean Air program — subsidy for house insulation and facade up to 135,000 PLN. We help with documentation and execution. Krakow and Malopolska." schemaType="services" locale="en">
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-16 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900"></div></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-red-600"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8"><a href="/en" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/en/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a><span>/</span><span class="text-orange-400">Clean Air Program — Facade Subsidy</span></nav>
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20 mb-6"><span class="text-orange-400 text-sm font-semibold">Government Program</span></div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Clean Air <span class="text-gradient">Program</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Get up to 135,000 PLN in subsidy for house insulation, facade work, window replacement, and heating modernization. We handle everything — from application to settlement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">What is the <span class="text-gradient">Clean Air program</span>?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Clean Air (Czyste Powietrze) is a Polish government program aimed at improving energy efficiency and reducing pollutant emissions from single-family homes. It provides subsidies for thermal modernization, including wall and roof insulation, window and door replacement, heating source modernization, and renewable energy installation.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">The program offers three funding levels depending on household income: basic (up to 66,000 PLN, covering 40% of costs), enhanced (up to 99,000 PLN, 70% of costs), and maximum (up to 135,000 PLN, 90% of costs). As an authorized program partner, we provide comprehensive support from eligibility checking through application completion to post-work settlement.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Our team handles the complete process — energy audit, cost estimate preparation, application submission, work execution according to program requirements, and final settlement documentation. This means less paperwork stress for you and maximum subsidy utilization.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-10 text-center">Subsidy <span class="text-gradient">levels</span></h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-2">66,000</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">PLN — Basic level</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Up to 40% of eligible costs. For households with annual income up to 135,000 PLN.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-red-200 shadow-sm text-center ring-2 ring-red-500">
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-red-600 mb-2">99,000</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">PLN — Enhanced level</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Up to 70% of eligible costs. For households with monthly income per person up to 1,894 PLN.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm text-center">
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-orange-500 mb-2">135,000</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">PLN — Maximum level</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Up to 90% of eligible costs. For households with monthly income per person up to 1,090 PLN.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Start your <span class="text-gradient">Clean Air</span> application today</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Contact us for a free eligibility check and subsidy estimate. We handle the entire process from start to finish.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl transition-colors">Check your eligibility</a>
        <a href="tel:+48515156233" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-colors">Call: 515-156-233</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
